## Reminder for Claude when starting a session

```
Re-read CLAUDE.md and docs/ai-context/INDEX.md from disk.
Identify task type → pick the minimum docs + rules.
Check .claude/rules/*.md frontmatter for the paths you'll edit, read matching rules.
Use a specialist agent only when useful.
Smallest safe change.
Definition of done includes rule files read.
```
